OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 23, admits possessing
OL,4,Aterrorist documents including IRA
OL,5,Amanual
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 23-year-old man has pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fpossessing terrorist documents,
OL,9,Fincluding an IRA manual.
OL,11,FJac Glyn Pari Edwards, from Barmouth,
OL,12,FGwynedd, was found with four documents
OL,13,Fthat would likely be useful to a person
OL,14,Fcommitting or preparing an act of
OL,15,Fterrorism.
OL,17,FThe documents included an IRA manual,
OL,18,FThe Anarchist Cookbook - which contains
OL,19,Finstructions on how to manufacture
OL,20,Fexplosives - a manual on ethnic
OL,21,Fcleansing operations, as well as one on
OL,22,Fguerrilla warfare.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
